# Decisions

Project-owned architecture decision records. Template updates never change this folder.

Add one file per decision: `NNNN-short-title.md`, numbered in order, never renumbered or deleted. Supersede a decision with a new record that links to the old one.

```markdown
# NNNN. Title

- Date: YYYY-MM-DD
- Status: proposed | accepted | superseded by NNNN

## Context
## Decision
## Consequences
```
